# Ootle Game Engine | .gitignore
# Version: v0.3.0
# Build outputs, local deployment journals and secrets stay out of source control.
**/target/
**/Cargo.lock
!engine-tests/Cargo.lock
!app/Cargo.lock
app/data/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.env
.env.*
*.cookie
*.key
*.pem
deployments/bootstrap-state.json
deployments/*-state.json
deployments/*.tmp
# End of .gitignore
